OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 24 JAN
OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GThe Swedish Radio Symphony
OL,6,     GOrchestra performs Ravel's Piano
OL,7,     GConcerto in G with Lucas
OL,8,     GDebargue. Opening the concert is
OL,9,     GEleven Gates, a piece by Swedish
OL,10,     Gcomposer Anders Hillborg.
OL,11,G0630FBreakfast
OL,12,     GHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,13,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,14,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,15,G0900FSaturday Morning
OL,16,     GTom Service talks to conductor
OL,17,     GVladimir Jurowski about his love
OL,18,     Gof Mahler and hears about a
OL,19,     Gconcert celebrating the words and
OL,20,     Gmusic of Persian women.
